The board drivers, the DGT serial protocol, the loop and bus code, the
board emulator, the transports and the capture format came from Alnasl
(https://github.com/teapot-chess/Alnasl), by the same owner. They were moved here so the code exists once: Alnasl now uses
them from this package. Changes: the module names (Alnasl.* -> Arkab.*) and
the application environment (:alnasl -> :arkab).

Arkab is not affiliated with or endorsed by DGT (Digital Game Technology
B.V.). "DGT" is their trademark. The serial protocol implemented in
lib/arkab/dgt/ follows DGT's published protocol description for
single-board communication; no DGT code is included.
